          "page": 112,
          "path": "page-112.md",
          "start_line": 1,
          "end_line": 59,
          "start_text": "<!-- source-page-112 -->",
          "end_text": "Marco is the primary voice and face of the Spektral Krew. He handles all of the intros and outros, provides primary commentary and direction for the investigation, and makes the big decisions about every aspect of the show. He actively encourages live disagreements on the air as he is well aware that this is something that his audience loves.",
