          "start_text": "<!-- source-page-113 -->",
          "end_text": "![Complete front page of Corrina Trench's pre-generated investigator sheet](../assets/00f35cb2535f45bfce6b8cc61c4bbf9fd5a493f2f63995a5608f14edfabfb782.jpg)",
          "sha256_lf_lines": "1F4AB6EFECDB931B3414EF8A7627FD49E5F8BC695D0F4C91C985A6F55DAFA042"
        },
        {
          "page": 114,
          "path": "page-114.md",
          "start_line": 1,
          "end_line": 58,
          "start_text": "<!-- source-page-114 -->",
          "end_text": "Every good ghost hunting show needs a psychic, and that's Corrina. She gets the second most amount of camera time after Marco, and he always calls her in to ramp up the creepiness and drama. She's the one who operates the Spirit Box, and often performs seances, dowsing, and of course uses her Witch Board to communicate with the dead. This latter item she bought on Etsy.",
          "sha256_lf_lines": "132CAC2E137A6E8DDA3D839F48058FD99B8C613A1C9B8CC2FBDDBC8534202E8F"
        }
      ],
      "owner": "Corrina Trench",
