          "start_line": 1,
          "end_line": 58,
          "start_text": "<!-- source-page-116 -->",
          "end_text": "Officially, Enoch is basically the Krew's 'roadie' who moves all of the heavier equipment, sets up gear, and ensures that everyone is safe. Enoch also serves as the secondary camera operator, and usually focuses on Corrina. Unofficially, Enoch is Marco's personal bodyguard. And of course, Enoch has strange powers that he keeps to himself.",
