          "start_line": 1,
          "end_line": 62,
          "start_text": "<!-- source-page-118 -->",
          "end_text": "While many cameras are used to capture all the action, the primary camera is operated by Peter and he tries to make sure that Marco always looks awesome to the audience. His secondary responsibilities include taking EM readings, and acting as a sounding board for Marco, so he's not just talking to himself. Peter rarely appears on camera, but does show up occasionally on the secondary cameras and some of the FLIR footage.",
